  "worked_solution": "The general solution of the system is\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}x(t) \\\\ y(t)\\end{aligned}]={c}_{1}{e}^{4t}[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]+{c}_{2}{e}^{3t}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],\\,{c}_{1},{c}_{2}\\in R.\n$$\n\nThe line that passes through the origin and is parallel to ${v}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]$ has the equation \n\n$$\ny=-\\frac{1}{2}x\n$$\n\nand the straight-line solutions of the form\n${c}_{1}{e}^{4t}[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]$\nlie on that line. \n\nSince ${e}^{4t}\\to \\infty $ as $t\\to \\infty ,$ these solutions approach $\\text{infinity}$ as $t\\to \\infty .$\n\nLet's add the solutions to the phase space.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14072827/assets/1d2a232b4351c84871d89ba25384aa53777760355ceea6458b07fba9c0a9ed78.png)\n\nThe line that passes through the origin and is parallel to ${v}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]$ has the equation \n\n$$\ny=0\n$$\n\nand the straight-line solutions of the form\n${c}_{2}{e}^{3t}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]$\nlie on that line.\n\nSince ${e}^{3t}\\to \\infty $ as $t\\to \\infty ,$ these solutions approach $\\text{infinity}$ as $t\\to \\infty .$\n\nLet's add the solutions to the phase space.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14072827/assets/122759a459c8dd56dbe69c44c0da4ccffbbc660465fbedc7457e17b42430436e.png)\n\nFor this particular system, we have\n\n$$\n0<{\\lambda }_{2}<{\\lambda }_{1}\n$$\n\nthus, ${\\lambda }_{1}=4$ is the dominant eigenvalue.\n\nSince the dominant eigenvalue is ${\\lambda }_{1}=4,$  solutions become parallel to the straight-line solution containing the vector  ${v}_{1}$ as they move away from the origin.\n\nThe phase portrait of our system looks as follows:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14072827/assets/fcaa3ba63a1e6ad061eecf1f72caf3c9f8ba78b014eff044ee5be682e1325128.png)",
